{"sha": "6057c7513301861365247b76cce370ad3a958bc777dace3216019318b87da618", "body": ["对于物质的量可以改变的相（通过反应，或与", "另一相交换物质），有", "\\[", "  \\dd G = V\\dd p - S\\dd T + \\sum_i\\mu_i\\,\\dd n_i ,\\qquad G = \\sum_i n_i\\mu_i ,", "\\]", "其中第二式由欧拉恒等式得到。对于单一反应，$\\dd n_i =", "\\nu_i\\dd\\xi$，与\\cref{prop:b2:reaction-free-energy:dG}比较，得", "\\[", "  \\Delta_r G = \\sum_i\\nu_i\\mu_i .", "\\]", "反应吉布斯自由能是生成物与", "反应物化学势之差。", "", "\\begin{theorem}[相间平衡]\\label{thm:b2:chemical-potential:phase-equilibrium}", "在闭合系统中，某组分同时存在于两相 $\\alpha$ 与 $\\beta$ 中，", "两相的温度 $T$ 与压强 $p$ 均匀时，该组分在两相间处于平衡的充要条件是", "$\\mu_i^\\alpha = \\mu_i^\\beta$。否则，它会自发地从化学势较高的相", "转移到化学势较低的相。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "转移过程 $i^\\alpha \\to i^\\beta$ 是一个“反应”，其中 $\\nu^\\alpha = -1$，", "$\\nu^\\beta = +1$，故 $\\Delta_r G = \\mu_i^\\beta - \\mu_i^\\alpha$。由", "演化判据，过程正向进行（$\\dd\\xi > 0$）的条件是 $\\mu_i^\\beta <", "\\mu_i^\\alpha$，逆向进行的条件是 $\\mu_i^\\beta > \\mu_i^\\alpha$，", "二者相等时处于平衡。", "\\end{proof}", "", "化学势之于物质，犹如温度之于热量：", "热量由高温流向低温，物种则由 $\\mu$ 高处流向低处。", "", "\\section{理想体系与活度}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[理想气体的化学势]\\label{prop:b2:chemical-potential:mu-gas}", "在理想气体混合物中，分压为 $p_i$ 的气体具有", "\\[", "  \\mu_i = \\mu_i^\\circ(T) + RT\\ln\\frac{p_i}{p^\\circ} .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "对于一摩尔纯理想气体，有 $(\\partial\\mu/\\partial p)_T = V_m =", "RT/p$；从 $p^\\circ$ 积分到 $p$，得 $\\mu = \\mu^\\circ + RT\\ln(p/p^\\circ)$。", "在理想气体混合物中，每种气体的行为如同单独占据该体积，且处于", "其分压：将 $p$ 替换为 $p_i$ 即可。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{definition}[理想混合物，理想稀溶液]\\label{def:b2:chemical-potential:ideal-mixture}", "若液态（或固态）混合物对每一组分及每一组成均满足下式，", "则称其为\\emph{理想混合物}\\index{理想混合物}：", "$\\mu_i = \\mu_i^*(T, p) + RT\\ln x_i$，其中 $\\mu_i^*$ 为纯液体 $i$ 的化学势。", "溶液称为\\emph{理想稀溶液}\\index{理想稀溶液}，若其溶剂服从此定律，且", "每种溶质满足", "$\\mu_j = \\mu_j^\\circ(T) + RT\\ln(c_j/c^\\circ)$，其中标准状态为", "$c^\\circ = \\qty{1}{mol/L}$ 的假想溶液，", "其行为如同无限稀释。", "\\end{definition}", "", "大小和形状相近、相互作用与伙伴无关的分子，", "（例如苯与甲苯、同一分子的两种同位素形式）近似形成理想混合物；", "稀溶液表现出理想行为，因为每个溶质", "粒子周围只有溶剂分子。", "", "\\begin{theorem}[拉乌尔定律]\\label{thm:b2:chemical-potential:raoult}", "在理想液体混合物上方，若蒸气为理想气体，则每一组分的分压", "与其在液相中的摩尔分数成正比：$p_i = x_i\\,p_i^*$，", "其中 $p_i^*$ 为同一温度下纯液体的蒸气压", "（\\emph{拉乌尔定律}\\index{拉乌尔定律}）。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "平衡时 $\\mu_i(\\text{液体}) = \\mu_i(\\text{蒸气})$：$\\mu_i^* +", "RT\\ln x_i = \\mu_i^\\circ + RT\\ln(p_i/p^\\circ)$。对于纯液体（$x_i = 1$，", "$p_i = p_i^*$）：$\\mu_i^* = \\mu_i^\\circ + RT\\ln(p_i^*/p^\\circ)$。两式相减，", "得 $RT\\ln x_i = RT\\ln(p_i/p_i^*)$。（忽略 $\\mu_i^*$ 对", "压强的微弱依赖。）", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[亨利定律]\\label{prop:b2:chemical-potential:henry}", "对于与其蒸气处于平衡的稀溶质 $j$，有 $p_j = k_{H,j}\\,x_j$", "（或 $c_j = H_j\\,p_j$）：稀溶质的分压", "与其在溶液中的物质的量成正比（\\emph{亨利定律}\\index{亨利定律}）。", "其\\emph{亨利常数}\\index{亨利常数}", "$k_{H,j}$ 取决于溶质、溶剂与温度，", "且不等于纯溶质的蒸气压。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "令 $\\mu_j^\\circ(\\text{溶液}) + RT\\ln(c_j/c^\\circ)$ 与", "$\\mu_j^\\circ(\\text{气体}) + RT\\ln(p_j/p^\\circ)$ 相等，$c_j/p_j$ 仅", "是 $T$ 的函数。该常数包含 $j$ 与溶剂的相互作用，而非", "它与自身的相互作用。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[name=a,", "  width=0.48\\linewidth, height=5.6cm, xmin=0, xmax=1, ymin=0, ymax=1.5,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel={$x_1$}, ylabel={$p/p_1^*$},", "  xtick={0,0.5,1}, ytick={0,0.5,1,1.5},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}, title={\\small 理想}]", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=x1, y=p1] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-raoult-henry-ideal.dat};", "\\addplot[omThm, thick] table[x=x1, y=p2] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-raoult-henry-ideal.dat};", "\\addplot[black, very thick] table[x=x1, y=p] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-raoult-henry-ideal.dat};", "\\node[omDef, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:0.55,0.42) {$p_1$};", "\\node[omThm, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:0.1,0.42) {$p_2$};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south] at (axis cs:0.5,0.8) {$p$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\begin{axis}[at={(a.east)}, anchor=west, xshift=1.2cm,", "  width=0.48\\linewidth, height=5.6cm, xmin=0, xmax=1, ymin=0, ymax=1.5,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel={$x_1$},", "  xtick={0,0.5,1}, ytick={0,0.5,1,1.5},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}, title={\\small 正偏差}]", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=x1, y=p1] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-raoult-henry-margules.dat};", "\\addplot[omThm, thick] table[x=x1, y=p2] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-raoult-henry-margules.dat};", "\\addplot[black, very thick] table[x=x1, y=p] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-raoult-henry-margules.dat};", "\\addplot[omDef, densely dashed, domain=0.6:1] {x};", "\\addplot[omDef, dotted, thick, domain=0:0.42] {3.004166*x};", "\\node[omDef, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:0.62,0.5) {拉乌尔};", "\\node[omDef, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=east] at (axis cs:0.27,1.18) {亨利};", "\\node[omDef, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north west] at (axis cs:0.8,0.78) {$p_1$};", "\\node[omThm, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north] at (axis cs:0.55,0.24) {$p_2$};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south] at (axis cs:0.5,1.23) {$p$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}